d susoassign: create and upload Survey Solutions assignments, with prefilled and protected answers
d
d Builds assignments from Stata data (main level, rosters, web mode, protected answers),
d validates them against the questionnaire and creates them on Survey Solutions Headquarters
d through its API. Runs in Stata's bundled Java: no R or Python needed.
d
d Author: Emanuele Clemente
d Support: https://github.com/emawbgit/SuSoAssign/issues
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261117
d Requires: Stata version 16
f susoassign.ado
f susoassign.sthlp
f susoassign.jar
